  "description": "Express.js (Node.js) replica of the Spring Boot Item Kafka Producer/Consumer + Apache Flink POC: REST API + Kafka producer/consumer + Node-based streaming pipeline jobs (Flink-equivalent) + MySQL/SQL Server integration.",
